High Temple: Long-Lost Labyrinth~
Paul Clarke~
   A small tremor has opened a narrow opening in the foundation of the temple.
Something lies below. It seems the temple was built upon an older structure,
long forgotten, unexplored and unknown. It certainly predates the empire. But
who built it -- and why -- are lost to time. With any luck, it has been sealed
so long that no one has looted it. Yet.
~
